  "name": "Fiend's streamed tooltip matches its cost-only Infernal Strike benefit (#5293)",
  "contract": "Fiend talent 705005 says that casting Sever removes the cost of the next Infernal Strike, without promising additional damage. Current native contracts make helper 680197 a -100% cost modifier and disable its second effect. Its authored aura tooltip still says the next strike 'deals ${$w2}% increased damage', which becomes a misleading zero-damage clause in the effective spell row. Publish 'Your next Infernal Strike is free of cost.' through the existing ToolTip override. Normal War specialization and Fiend acquisition, ordinary Sever and Infernal Strike casts, an untalented caster, nonzero pre-buff cost, unchanged damage/unrelated-spell cost, helper consumption and restored cost exercise the benefit independently of the text. Helper 680197 has an authored sixty-second duration and DO_NOT_DISPLAY_DURATION; this regression observes the native duration but does not change that display policy or claim client timer/rendering acceptance.",
